; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: each group of postings -- the
; real ones, and the balanced virtual ones in [brackets] -- may have one
; posting without an amount, which balances that group alone.  When no
; other posting of its group has an amount, it is zero, as long as the
; other group has some (see 3314_elided.test).  Ledger 3.4 gave the
; second and third transactions a zero there too, and rejected the first
; only because it has two postings without amounts; the separate
; balancing of #2105 had made all three "null amounts" errors.

2018-10-22 Revenue
    Revenues
    Assets:Test                      10.00 EUR
    [Assets:Bank]

2018-10-23 Transfer
    Assets:Test                     -10.00 EUR
    Assets:Other                     10.00 EUR
    [Assets:Bank]

2018-10-24 Budget
    [Budget:Food]                    50.00 EUR
    [Equity:Budget]                 -50.00 EUR
    Expenses:Misc

test reg --empty
18-Oct-22 Revenue               Revenues                 -10.00 EUR   -10.00 EUR
                                Assets:Test               10.00 EUR            0
                                [Assets:Bank]                     0            0
18-Oct-23 Transfer              Assets:Test              -10.00 EUR   -10.00 EUR
                                Assets:Other              10.00 EUR            0
                                [Assets:Bank]                     0            0
18-Oct-24 Budget                [Budget:Food]             50.00 EUR    50.00 EUR
                                [Equity:Budget]          -50.00 EUR            0
                                Expenses:Misc                     0            0
end test

test bal --real
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Other
          -10.00 EUR  Revenues
--------------------
                   0
end test

test print
2018/10/22 Revenue
    Revenues
    Assets:Test                            10.00 EUR
    [Assets:Bank]

2018/10/23 Transfer
    Assets:Test                           -10.00 EUR
    Assets:Other                           10.00 EUR
    [Assets:Bank]

2018/10/24 Budget
    [Budget:Food]                          50.00 EUR
    [Equity:Budget]                       -50.00 EUR
    Expenses:Misc
end test
